From: System Electronics <riccardo.fiocchi00@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] scmi: expect SCU-FW 1.7.0 (SCMI 0.47.2) for the cross-matrix test

DIAGNOSTIC ONLY - do not merge into a release branch.

Builds a kernel that accepts the 1.7.0 SCU firmware, so the 1.12 kernel and
device tree can be run against the older firmware. The DSI display resets the
board on 1.12 and works on 1.7.0 with the same kernel-side code (the DSI path is
byte-identical between the two), so the firmware is the last untested variable.
Pairing a 1.12 kernel with the 1.7.0 firmware is what tells the two apart.

Three separate checks compare the kernel against the firmware, and all three
resolve to SCU_FW_SCMI_VERSION, so one value change covers them:

  drivers/firmware/arm_scmi/driver.c:1882            panic() on macro vs impl_ver
  drivers/firmware/arm_scmi/driver.c:1890            panic() on DT fw-ver vs impl_ver
  drivers/firmware/arm_scmi/scmi_hailo_protocol.c    -EINVAL, kills the Hailo protocol

The second one reads the device tree property, which is itself written as
fw-ver = <SCU_FW_SCMI_VERSION> in hailo1x-base.dtsi.

Both copies of the header have to change. They are two real files, not a symlink:
include/ feeds the C compiler and scripts/dtc/include-prefixes/ feeds the device
tree compiler. Patching only one makes the DTB and the compiled-in macro disagree,
which trips the DT check and panics - the exact failure this patch exists to avoid.

0.47.2 -> (0 << 24) | (47 << 16) | 2 = 0x002F0002
0.50.1 -> (0 << 24) | (50 << 16) | 1 = 0x00320001

Revert before releasing anything.

---
 include/dt-bindings/soc/hailo15_scu_fw_version.h              | 4 ++--
 scripts/dtc/include-prefixes/dt-bindings/soc/hailo15_scu_fw_version.h | 4 ++--
 2 files changed, 4 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/include/dt-bindings/soc/hailo15_scu_fw_version.h b/include/dt-bindings/soc/hailo15_scu_fw_version.h
--- a/include/dt-bindings/soc/hailo15_scu_fw_version.h
+++ b/include/dt-bindings/soc/hailo15_scu_fw_version.h
@@ -7,8 +7,8 @@
 #define HAILO15_SCU_FW_VERSION_H

 #define SCU_FW_MAJOR 0
-#define SCU_FW_MINOR 50
-#define SCU_FW_REVISION 1
+#define SCU_FW_MINOR 47
+#define SCU_FW_REVISION 2
 #define SCU_FW_SCMI_VERSION (((SCU_FW_MAJOR) << 24) | ((SCU_FW_MINOR) << 16) | (SCU_FW_REVISION))

 #endif /* HAILO15_SCU_FW_VERSION_H */
diff --git a/scripts/dtc/include-prefixes/dt-bindings/soc/hailo15_scu_fw_version.h b/scripts/dtc/include-prefixes/dt-bindings/soc/hailo15_scu_fw_version.h
--- a/scripts/dtc/include-prefixes/dt-bindings/soc/hailo15_scu_fw_version.h
+++ b/scripts/dtc/include-prefixes/dt-bindings/soc/hailo15_scu_fw_version.h
@@ -7,8 +7,8 @@
 #define HAILO15_SCU_FW_VERSION_H

 #define SCU_FW_MAJOR 0
-#define SCU_FW_MINOR 50
-#define SCU_FW_REVISION 1
+#define SCU_FW_MINOR 47
+#define SCU_FW_REVISION 2
 #define SCU_FW_SCMI_VERSION (((SCU_FW_MAJOR) << 24) | ((SCU_FW_MINOR) << 16) | (SCU_FW_REVISION))

 #endif /* HAILO15_SCU_FW_VERSION_H */
